<title>USA: TransMontaigne Oil names new president.</title>
<headline>TransMontaigne Oil names new president.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransMontaigne Oil Co said Wednesday it had elected Richard Gathright president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>He succeeds Cortlandt Dietler, who will remain chairman and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>W.A. Sikora was named executive vice president.</p>
<p>Both Gathright and Sikora remain officers of Continental Ozark Inc, a unit of TransMontaigne.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk (212) 859-1610</p>
